  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Preheat the oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced.<br>• Cut the cauliflower into small florets. Cut the sweet potato into small chunks. Cut the red onion into thick wedges.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e20b68f8f6928425d5c291/step-63d15500.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Place the prepped veggies on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with some oil from the marinated goat cheese (save the rest of the oil for the dressing!).<br>• Sprinkle with the chermoula spice blend and season with salt and pepper. Toss to coat.<br>• Roast until tender, 20-25 minutes.<br><br>TIP: If your oven tray is crowded, divide the veggies between two trays.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e20b68f8f6928425d5c291/step-7b18f610.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• While the veggies are roasting, heat drizzle of olive oil in a large saucepan over medium-high heat.<br>• Toast the pearl couscous, stirring occasionally, until golden, 1-2 minutes.<br>• Carefully half-fill the saucepan with water, then add a pinch of salt. Simmer, uncovered, until tender, 14-16 minutes.<br>• Drain, rinse and return to the pan. Add the vegetable stock powder and drizzle of olive oil. Stir to combine.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e20b68f8f6928425d5c291/step-926ac420.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• In a large bowl, combine some oil from the goat cheese packet (1 tbs for 2 people / 2 tbs for 4 people) with the vinegar and honey. Season to taste.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e20b68f8f6928425d5c291/step-e674c230.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• To the bowl with the dressing, add spinach &amp; rocket mix, pearl couscous and roasted veggies. Gently toss to combine.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e20b68f8f6928425d5c291/step-364cf340.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Divide the spiced cauliflower salad between plates.<br>• Crumble the goat cheese over the salad. Sprinkle with flaked almonds to serve. Enjoy!</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e20b68f8f6928425d5c291/step-e5544950.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
